OL,3,GNEWSA'Building homes at former cemetery
OL,4,Adisrespectful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build homes at a former
OL,7,Fcemetery in Shrewsbury are
OL,8,Fdisrespectful, campaigners say.
OL,10,FMore than 200 people are buried in the
OL,11,Fformer Wellspring Apostolic Church
OL,12,Fcemetery off Belle Vue Road, where
OL,13,Fdevelopers have applied to build eight
OL,14,Fhomes, garages and a memorial garden.
OL,16,FThe grounds were established in 1852,
OL,17,Ffor those deemed dissenters and whose
OL,18,Fburials were not accepted by the Church
OL,19,Fof England.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
