OL,3,GNEWSA'Building homes at former cemetery
OL,4,Adisrespectful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say 43 gravestones will be
OL,7,Fmoved into a memorial garden, while the
OL,8,Fremains of those buried would remain
OL,9,Funderneath the homes. The developers
OL,10,Fhave stressed they will follow a strict
OL,11,Flegal process as set out by the
OL,12,FMinistry of Justice, respectfully deal
OL,13,Fwith anything they discover.
